  "soporte_faq_p1": "1. What does water turbidity mean?",
  "soporte_faq_r1": "Turbidity indicates the amount of particles present in the water. A high value can affect quality.",
  "soporte_faq_p2": "2. What does water pH mean?",
  "soporte_faq_r2": "pH indicates the acidity or alkalinity of the water. A high value can affect quality.",
  "soporte_faq_p3": "3. Why do I receive water level notifications?",
